    <string name="instant_setup_title">Turn on instant alerts?</string>
    <string name="instant_setup_message">The app will switch on Seerr\'s ntfy notifications for new requests and send them to a private, randomly named topic on the free ntfy.sh service. The app keeps a lightweight connection open to receive them.\n\nYou can use your own ntfy server instead. If yours needs a login, set it up under Seerr → Settings → Notifications → ntfy first, then come back here.</string>
